      en: ["Highest peak is Cvijićev vrh (1,132 m)", "The name translates to mine in Serbian", "Geologically formed by ancient volcanic activity", "Central hydrological hub of Šumadija", "First Serbian coins were minted here", "Rich in lead, zinc, and silver deposits"],
